## 📖 About the Project

The **Scientific Calculator** is a Java-based desktop application developed to strengthen practical knowledge of **GUI development**, **Java Swing**, **event handling**, and **Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)**.

Built with the `javax.swing` library, the application provides an intuitive graphical interface where users can perform calculations through interactive buttons.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🖥️ Interactive Java Swing GUI
- 🔢 Button-based numeric input
- ➕ Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication & Division
- 🧹 Clear (C) functionality
- ⬅️ Backspace/Delete support
- ⚡ Event-driven programming using Action Listeners
- 🎨 Clean and user-friendly interface
- 💻 Lightweight desktop application

