## ⚙️ Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or later)
- Apache NetBeans IDE 22

### Installation

#### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/priyanshi17112007/Scientific_calculator.git
```

#### 2. Open in NetBeans

- Launch **Apache NetBeans IDE 22**
- Go to **File → Open Project**
- Select the cloned project folder

#### 3. Run the Application

- Right-click the project
- Select **Run**
- Or press **F6**

